This Consulting Agreement (this "Agreement" {{def: agreement}}) is entered into on
{{placeholder: effective-date, type=date}} between {{party: acme}} and {{party: client}}.

# Definitions {#definitions}

"Consulting Services" {{def: consulting-services}} means the advisory services described in
{{ref: scope}}.

# Scope of Engagement {#scope}

{{party: acme, label=the Consultant}} shall provide the {{term: consulting-services}} described
below:

- {{placeholder: service-description-1}} {#scope-item-1}
- {{placeholder: service-description-2}} {#scope-item-2}

The engagement begins on {{placeholder: effective-date, type=date}} and continues for
{{placeholder: engagement-duration}} unless terminated earlier.

# Fees {#fees}

The Client shall pay {{placeholder: fee-amount, type=money, currency=EUR}} for the
{{term: consulting-services}}, payable within {{duration: 30, unit=D}} of invoice.

Expenses are reimbursed only where approved in advance in writing.

# Confidentiality {#confidentiality}

Each party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other in
connection with the {{term: agreement}}.

# Governing Law {#governing-law}

The {{term: agreement}} is governed by the laws of {{placeholder: governing-law}}, and the parties
submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of {{placeholder: forum}}.
